  "title": "FSSAI prosecutes Surya Food & Agro over cattle feed bran in biscuits",
  "summary": "The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) has initiated legal proceedings against Surya Food & Agro for using cattle feed bran in manufacturing of Priyagold biscuits, alongside other operators for serious food safety violations. The action includes notices to Dodla Dairy and UEIR Organic Foods, which were found to have substandard milk and pesticide residues.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "FSSAI has initiated legal proceedings against Surya Food & Agro for using cattle feed bran in manufacturing of Priyagold biscuits.",
